[Observation & Conclusion]:
  - Physical Media: Ethernet crossover pinout successfully pairs DTE Tx pins (1,2)
    with DTE Rx pins (3,6) between two peer PCs without an intervening DCE.
  - ARP Mechanics: Initial ping triggered an ARP broadcast request; upon receipt
    of the unicast ARP reply, both hosts populated dynamic ARP entries.
  - Result: 0% packet loss, bilateral ping verified successfully.
